<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> - Express Routing App</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">
      <a href="/" class="nav-brand">Express Routing</a>
      <ul class="nav-menu">
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a href="/" class="nav-link">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a href="/services" class="nav-link active">Our Services</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a href="/contact" class="nav-link">Contact Us</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="content">
      <h1>Our Services</h1>
      <p>Discover the range of services we offer to meet your needs.</p>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card">
          <h2>Web Development</h2>
          <p>We build responsive and modern web applications using the latest technologies 
          including Express.js, Node.js, and front-end frameworks.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Full-stack development</li>
            <li>API creation</li>
            <li>Database design</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <h2>Server-Side Rendering</h2>
          <p>Our expertise in template engines like EJS allows us to render dynamic 
          content server-side for better SEO and initial page load performance.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>EJS templates</li>
            <li>Pug templates</li>
            <li>Custom middleware</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <h2>Routing & Middleware</h2>
          <p>We design robust routing systems and custom middleware to handle business logic, 
          authentication, logging, and validation efficiently.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Route management</li>
            <li>Middleware creation</li>
            <li>Request handling</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="service-card">
          <h2>Deployment & Maintenance</h2>
          <p>Our team ensures your applications are properly deployed and maintained for 
          optimal performance and reliability.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Cloud deployment</li>
            <li>Monitoring</li>
            <li>Performance optimization</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Express Routing Application. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
